UID:fed-fbar-2025-04-15@ustaxcalendar.com
DTSTAMP:20260924T115707Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250416
SUMMARY:Federal: FinCEN 114 (FBAR) due
DESCRIPTION:Annual FBAR due date\, with automatic extension | FinCEN Form 1
 14 (FBAR) for calendar year 2025 is due April 15\, 2026. FinCEN grants an a
 utomatic extension to October 15\, 2026 for filers who miss the April deadl
 ine - no extension request is required. | Authority: FinCEN: "Filers ... ha
 ve an automatic extension up to October 15" (rule confirmed via FinCEN's of
 ficial Due Date Clarification notice\, applying the same April 15 original 
 / October 15 automatic-extension pattern to the current filing season). | S
 ource: https://www.fincen.gov/report-foreign-bank-and-financial-accounts | 
 This date is computed from a recurrence rule and may not reflect a later-an
 nounced change\; confirm against the cited source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
