BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fed-3520-2025-04-15@ustaxcalendar.com
DTSTAMP:20260924T115707Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250416
SUMMARY:Federal: 3520 due
DESCRIPTION:Rides the individual income tax return due date (calendar-year 
 individual filer) | Form 3520 for a calendar-year individual is due April 1
 5\, 2026\, the same day as the income tax return. U.S. citizens/residents l
 iving and working abroad may get an automatic extension to June 15\, 2026\;
  if an extension of time to file the income tax return is granted\, Form 35
 20 is due no later than October 15\, 2026. | Authority: IRS Instructions fo
 r Form 3520: "a U.S. person's Form 3520 is due on the 15th day of the 4th m
 onth following the end of such person's tax year"\; extended to October 15 
 if the income tax return is extended. | Source: https://www.irs.gov/instruc
 tions/i3520 | This date is computed from a recurrence rule and may not refl
 ect a later-announced change\; confirm against the cited source before rely
 ing on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
